    "common_settings": {
      "taxpayer_category": "Individual",
      "residential_status": "Resident",
      "age": "below 60",
      "type_of_itr": "Other than updated return"
    },
    "notes": [
      "Amounts are rupees, written as strings (ADR 0001).",
      "expected.* values are copied from the calculator. Every one also matched a hand calculation done before entering it.",
      "total_tax is the calculator's 'Total Tax on Income' line: tax after rebate, plus surcharge, plus cess. It excludes interest and fees.",
      "No TDS or advance tax was entered, and the submission date field reset to 29-Oct-2026 during the session, so the PDFs show interest under 234A/234B/234C and a 234F fee. Ignore those lines; they are not part of total_tax.",
      "The calculator takes net salary only. Where inputs.salary has a breakdown (HRA), calculator_input shows the net figure that was actually typed in.",
      "Every total_tax here is already a multiple of 10, so these cases do not exercise section 288B rounding."
    ]
  },
